        "tags" : [ "Advanced" ],
        "summary" : "Create Transcript",
        "description" : "Create a new transcript for a call in your HubSpot account. This endpoint allows you to submit the details of a call transcript, including engagement ID and utterances, to be stored and managed within HubSpot. This is useful for integrating call transcription data into your CRM workflows.",
